# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal planning docs — NEVER commit.
# Public-facing docs are docs/logo.png and docs/screenshots/ only.
# Everything else under docs/ is internal (blueprints, board, specs,
# plans, verifications, audits). Whitelist the two public paths so
# adding more internal files is safe by default.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/*
!docs/logo.png
!docs/screenshots
!docs/screenshots/**

